WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:04.960
Friendly reminder to SCP Foundation staff:
Dr. Bright is not the “final boss” of

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.280
anything, except perhaps being an extremely
difficult employee.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:13.039
You do not have to battle Dr. Bright to be
allowed into the break room, nor is he allowed

00:00:13.039 --> 00:00:17.030
to blast his music loudly on the justification
that “It’s his boss theme.”

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.730
He won’t drop coins if you kill him, either.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.340
His medallion will just need to be put on
a new body.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.619
I really don’t get how new recruits keep
falling for this…

